#
# Ignore large non-deploy assets.
# The website lives in /Website and is safe to deploy.
#

# Large folders (source assets / notes)
Content-New/
Photos/
Logos/
Website Notes/
EMS-Magazine-Photos/

# Explicitly include the website assets (some ignore patterns may
# accidentally match nested directories like Website/assets/photos).
!Website/
!Website/**
!Website/assets/
!Website/assets/**
!Website/assets/photos/
!Website/assets/photos/**

# Large standalone files
*.pdf
*.psd
*.docx

# Known big images at repo root
A - 5.jpg

